Actor S_NegaSlashClaw : NegaSlashClaw { Damage (140) Args 240, 96, 48 }
Actor S_NegaSlashClaw2 : S_NegaSlashClaw { Damage (200) Reactiontime 4 Speed 55 Scale 3.0 Args 280, 128, 64 }
Actor S_NegaSlashClaw3 : S_NegaSlashClaw { Damage (300) Reactiontime 5 Speed 60 Scale 3.5 Args 360, 160, 80 }
